{"version":1,"content":"<p>APEC峰會即將於本月18日至19日在深圳舉行。</p><p>廣東省公安機關今天起全面啟動APEC會議安保高等級勤務，加大街頭警力部署，並從全省抽調警員支援深圳，同時加強無人機禁飛管控。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:47.518968+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T11:58:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.770879+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.770879+00:00","content_hash":"3d28fc6f7544f02d7ade4d361201fb80ff49d3bc0fa134f54be846c6cbd26d6d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}